@page "/examples"
@model Coldstart.Web.Pages.ExamplesModel
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Examples — real Coldstart drafts, unedited"; Layout = "_Layout"; }

<partial name="_PublicNav" />

<main class="static-page wrap wrap-narrow">
  <h1>Real drafts. Unedited.</h1>
  <p class="static-lede">Every example below is a genuine draft the engine produced on a real morning — including the ones it wrote to sell itself. Nothing is polished for this page; this is what lands in the briefing queue.</p>

  <article class="example-card">
    <p class="example-context">Written for a sample client selling <strong>recruiting software</strong>, minutes after Patronus AI announced a $50M round:</p>
    <div class="example-mail">
      <p class="example-subject">Subject: Scaling headcount with AI efficiency</p>
      <p>Patronus AI's nearly insatiable demand is a strong indicator the company is about to scale headcount, which can strain HR teams. AI-screened candidate shortlists can cut time-to-hire by 40%, letting HR focus on more strategic tasks. As you invest in new tooling, how are you planning to optimize hiring to keep up with demand?</p>
    </div>
    <p class="example-note ts">real draft · unedited</p>
  </article>

  <article class="example-card">
    <p class="example-context">Written by Coldstart, <strong>about Coldstart</strong> — this is how we find our own customers. The engine spotted Bluecore Energy's pre-seed round overnight:</p>
    <div class="example-mail">
      <p class="example-subject">Subject: Live demo (and free leads for Bluecore Energy)</p>
      <p>Hi there,</p>
      <p>Huge congrats on closing that $10M pre-seed round to bring portable nuclear reactors to the maritime sector!</p>
      <p>This email is actually a live demo. My engine, Coldstart, spotted your news overnight, analyzed your niche, and generated this:</p>
      <blockquote>Scaling this tech means you'll soon need to identify and engage decision-makers at major shipping lines, offshore logistics firms, and port authorities. Finding the right technical leads in such a niche, high-stakes industry is usually a massive time sink for a founding team.</blockquote>
      <p>Coldstart hunts for warm B2B leads overnight and drafts the first outreach for each one — it finds the exact companies that need what you sell, the morning their need appears. You wake up, review, hit send.</p>
      <p>Want to see what it finds for your product? I'll send you 3 real leads — 100% free, no card, nothing to install.</p>
      <p>I pre-filled your form (takes 30 sec): <span class="example-btn">Claim your free sample leads for Bluecore Energy</span></p>
    </div>
    <p class="example-note ts">real draft · unedited · the quoted block is the engine's own analysis</p>
  </article>

  <article class="example-card">
    <p class="example-context">Same morning, different market — the engine read Cascade's seed announcement (construction bidding software):</p>
    <div class="example-mail">
      <p class="example-subject">Subject: Live demo (and free leads for Cascade)</p>
      <p>Hi there,</p>
      <p>Huge congrats on the $3.5M seed round — that's a massive validation of the work you're doing to help construction firms win more bids!</p>
      <p>This email is actually a live demo. My engine, Coldstart, spotted your news overnight, analyzed your niche, and generated this:</p>
      <blockquote>With this capital, you are likely moving from founder-led sales to building a repeatable outbound engine to reach GCs and project leads. You will need to identify and engage decision-makers at mid-sized construction firms who are currently struggling to manage their project pipeline.</blockquote>
      <p>Coldstart hunts for warm B2B leads overnight and drafts the first outreach for each one — it finds the exact companies that need what you sell, the morning their need appears. You wake up, review, hit send.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="example-note ts">real draft · unedited · shortened for this page (the full email ends with the same free-leads offer)</p>
  </article>

  <div class="lp-cta-row static-cta">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/#get-leads">See it on your niche — 3 free leads</a>
    <a class="lp-quiet" href="/technology">How does it work? →</a>
  </div>
</main>
